291
00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:35.300
Okay.

292
00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:35.740
I don't know.

293
00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:36.120
Right.

294
00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:46.460
I'm just saying to that magazine and people that like to compare who wore it best or who's hot or who's not, I say suck it.

295
