300
00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:03.020
I'll have you know I've also been the subject of a who wore it beSt.

301
00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:03.560
Mm-hmm.

302
00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.480
So I feel that.

303
00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:05.900
Yeah.

