308
00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:11.540
Yeah.

309
00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:11.900
Okay?

310
00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:13.280
That's how I wore it.

311
00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:13.560
Period.

312
00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:14.260
That's my body.

313
00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.040
That's how my body wears stuff.

314
00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:17.760
How about who wore it?

315
00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:18.560
Me.

316
00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:18.860
Yeah.

317
00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:19.540
I wore it.

318
00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:19.980
Yeah.

319
00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:21.780
100% to me.

320
00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:22.100
Yes.

321
00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:22.960
For wearing it.

322
00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:23.760
And you know what?

323
00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:25.200
I got dressed this morning.

324
00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:25.840
You're welcome.

325
00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.540
As you can tell, this episode might have triggered something for us.

326
00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:35.500
