330
00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:41.760
Yes.

331
00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.340
I think, is this his most line count ever?

332
00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:45.500
Possibly.

333
00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:47.680
Well, I think we should get to some fast facts.

334
00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:48.460
I agree.

335
00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:49.280
