374
00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:40.960
Who asked, what inspired the subplot of the debate about whether or not Hilary Swank was hot or not?

375
00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:43.460
Was it a magazine that said who wore it best?

376
00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:44.740
It wasn't.

377
00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:46.360
It wasn't.

378
00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:52.040
BJ Novak did an interview with Indie Week, and he said that he was on a flight,

379
00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:55.140
and two of the in-flight movies were P.S.

380
