00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:04.680
He was tasked with coming up with a B-plot for an episode, and he thought, quote,

383
00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:06.540
why not debate about Hilary Swank?

384
00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:11.460
And then he decided that the characters could debate whether or not she is attractive.

