00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:20.440
Oh, wow.

389
00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:21.400
Good question.

390
00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:22.640
Very good question.

391
00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:27.360
Well, she did an interview with Time Magazine shortly after this episode came out.

392
00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:31.340
She was asked if she had seen the episode, and she said this,

