00:22:36.880 --> 00:22:42.280
Follow and listen to the We Do Not Care Club podcast with Melanie Sanders wherever you get your podcaSt.

522
00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:49.280
This episode opens with everyone just working at their desks.

523
00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:50.420
We're just working.

524
00:22:50.520 --> 00:22:51.280
Just a normal day.

525
00:22:51.440 --> 00:22:51.900
No biggie.

