00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:17.240
It goes over a door frame under Phyllis's desk, and Dwight crawls under Phyllis's desk.

537
00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:19.380
Oh, we did it a little differently.

538
00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:20.580
We did it a little differently.

539
00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:25.700
First of all, you can't crawl through Phyllis's desk because there was like a backstop, right?

540
00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:25.980
Yeah.

541
00:23:26.140 --> 00:23:28.440
So it doesn't go all the way through to Stanley's desk.

542
00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:31.640
And in the script, Phyllis says, Dwight, get out of there.

543
00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:33.600
And that's pretty much in the episode.

544
00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:35.920
And then Dwight would have said, shush, shush, shush.

545
00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:38.560
But I think Rain improvise.

546
00:23:38.740 --> 00:23:39.680
Shut up, Phyllis.

547
00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:44.200
So Dwight's going to follow this wire into the hall.

